      <h2>About Seaweed Center Paje</h2>
      <div>The Seaweed Center in Paje is a women's cooperative empowering local women through sustainable seaweed farming and value-added cosmetic production. Visitors learn the complete cultivation cycle — from planting seedlings on rope lines in the intertidal zone to harvesting, drying, and processing into organic skincare products including soaps, lotions, and scrubs. The center provides fair wages, training, and economic independence for over 50 women. Visitors can purchase products directly, supporting the cooperative. Combine with kitesurfing or Kuza Cave visit.</div>
